                                            or &#8220;PRC&#8221; refers to the People&#8217;s Republic of China, including Hong Kong,
                                            Macau and Taiwan; and &#8220;mainland China&#8221; refers to the People&#8217;s Republic
                                            of China, excluding Hong Kong, Macau and Taiwan;</span></td>
</tr></table><div>
