                                            or &#8220;Renminbi&#8221; refers to the legal currency of mainland China; &#8220;$,&#8221;
                                            &#8220;US$,&#8221; &#8220;dollars&#8221; or &#8220;U.S. dollars&#8221; refers to the legal
