</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Our
ADSs have been listed and traded on Nasdaq Global Select Market since April 3, 2014, and on Nasdaq Capital Market since November 17,
2023. Our ticker symbol was &#8220;TEDU&#8221; from April 3, 2014 to January 10, 2024 and became &#8220;TCTM&#8221; from January 10,
2024 through April 7, 2025, at which date it has been changed to &#8220;VSA.&#8221;</span></p><div>

