<td style="width: 0.5in"/><td style="text-align: left; width: 0.25in"><b><i>a.</i></b></td><td style="text-align: justify"><b><i>Revenue recognition (Continued)</i></b></td>
</tr>
</table><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center">&#160;</p><div>

